  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2801.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2801.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to any:\n\n(a) Sand and gravel source;\n\n(b) Non-metallic mineral processing plant; and\n\n(c) Cement, ready mix concrete, or cement block source.\n\nSource. #6428-B, eff 1-18-97 (formerly Env-A 1210); ss by #8218, eff 11-24-04; ss by #9793, eff 10-1-10 (from Env-A 2802.01); ss by #12693, eff 12-22-18",
